# headerpath-website — PUBLIC_* only; there are no secrets.
#
# The site is static. The one runtime integration is the /signup form, which
# POSTs to the product app's self-serve signup API and runs reCAPTCHA v3.
# Both are optional locally: without them the form posts to production and
# skips the captcha (the API then fails closed in production).

# Google reCAPTCHA v3 site key (the public one; the secret lives in headerpath-app)
PUBLIC_RECAPTCHA_SITE_KEY=

# Override only for local/preview testing against a non-production app host
# PUBLIC_SIGNUP_API_URL=https://get.headerpath.com/api/signup
